 tests/ext4/004     | 89 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tests/ext4/004.out |  2 ++
 tests/ext4/group   |  3 +-
 4 files changed, 95 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100755 tests/ext4/004
